cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This software implements the POMDP formalism of Kaelbling, Littman and Cassandra (1998)
  with an interface after Gym and Gymnasium. Please cite those works as well.
title: "jax-pomdps: POMDPs in JAX"
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Misha
    family-names: Lvovsky
